data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"\u003coutput of check-inputs, as strings, else empty\u003e],\"goal\":\"\u003cone sentence, in your own words: what this campaign is asking you to accomplish\u003e\",\"scope\":\"\u003cone sentence: what you own and what you must not touch\u003e\",\"obligations\":\"\u003cone sentence: what this campaign requires of you, and what happens to your work if you do not do it\u003e\"}\n```\n\nBranch: `cs-sandbox/<DEVELOPER:1>.<GROUP:1>`\nMissing: empty array (all inputs present)\nGoal: implement the orchestrator's design (greeting app) in React+Vite using @codesweep-ai/ui design system, and commit it to my branch.\nScope: I own my clone at ~/hello-app on my own branch; I must not commit to other branches or touch anything outside my repo/branch... Actually more precisely: implement what DESIGN.md says, build what the design names, don't expand scope.\nObligations: reply to dispatches, commit work to my branch (machine destroyed at end; only committed work survives), write durable outputs to the output dir.\n\nLet me write it as a single line."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1793342194,"id":"chatcmpl-ce071609","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

